d) - Backtest log analysis (P0 bugs identified)\n30\t- [QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md](./QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md) - Azure OpenAI LLM provider support\n31\t- [QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md](./QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md) - SPX/yfinance intraday data fix (P2)\n32\t- [QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md](./QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md) - Deprecated wait_sec cleanup (P3)\n33\t- [QuantAgent-6t4-PL-structured-output-vision-agents.md](./QuantAgent-6t4-PL-structured-output-vision-agents.md) - Structured output refactor for pattern/trend vision agents\n34\t- [QuantAgent-1p7-PL-stategraph-image-paths.md](./QuantAgent-1p7-PL-stategraph-image-paths.md) - Minimal implementation plan for disk-backed StateGraph visualization artifacts\n35\t\n36\t## Per-Change Planning Documents\n37\t\n38\tPer-change planning documents should follow this naming convention:\n39\t\n40\t```\n41\tQuantAgent-<issue-id>-PL-<short-slug>.md\n42\t```\n43\t\n44\tExample: `QuantAgent-a3f2dd-PL-backtest-optimization.md`\n45\t\n46\tThese files describe planning deltas, task breakdowns, and execution strategies for specific changes linked to Beads issues (when applicable for system implementations).\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c1e0874-30df-4cf1-a542-6d2be6b4889e","uuid":"33d32cc4-401e-410e-850b-e497af4212d5","timestamp":"2026-05-13T12:40:35.530Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/02_planning/README.md","content":"# Planning\n\nThis folder contains project roadmaps, task management, and planning artifacts for the QuantAgent system.\n\n## Reading Order\n\nAgents working in this repository should read planning documents in this order:\n\n1. **Current Phase Roadmaps** (start here)\n   - [phase1_roadmap.md](./phase1_roadmap.md) - Phase 1 development plan and milestones\n   - [phase2_roadmap.md](./phase2_roadmap.md) - Phase 2 development plan and milestones\n\n## Current Truth\n\n